            aOrbiterB = ((aOrbiterB + aOrbiterI) + 0x2B8C19D3268FEE4FULL) + aKeySpawnOrbiterUpdateSaltA[(((31U - aIndex) + 22U)) & S_SALT1];
            aOrbiterD = (aOrbiterD ^ aOrbiterB) ^ 0x045AB5C7841438CBULL;
